    "contentHtml": "<article class=\"tw-status\"><header><strong>Clelia Bertelli (/acc)</strong></header><div class=\"tw-body\"><br>几乎可以将任何内容转换为 PDF 格式，使用  <a style=\"color: rgb(29, 155, 240);\" class=\"css-1jxf684 r-bcqeeo r-1ttztb7 r-qvutc0 r-poiln3 r-1wvb978 r-1loqt21\" role=\"link\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer nofollow\" href=\"http://pdfitdown.app\" dir=\"ltr\"><span class=\"css-1jxf684 r-bcqeeo r-1ttztb7 r-qvutc0 r-poiln3 r-qlhcfr r-19qo34d r-qvk6io r-orgf3d r-u8s1d\" aria-hidden=\"true\">http://</span>pdfitdown.app</a> ！<br><br>我最近发布了 PdfItDown v3，这是我开发的一个用于将大多数文件格式转换为 PDF 的库。现在它还拥有一个全栈 Web 应用 :)<br><br>The frontend is built with  <a style=\"color: rgb(29, 155, 240);\" class=\"css-1jxf684 r-bcqeeo r-1ttztb7 r-qvutc0 r-poiln3 r-1wvb978 r-1loqt21\" role=\"link\" href=\"/tan_stack\" dir=\"ltr\">@tan_stack</a> <br> and deployed on a  <a style=\"color: rgb(29, 155, 240);\" class=\"css-1jxf684 r-bcqeeo r-1ttztb7 r-qvutc0 r-poiln3 r-1wvb978 r-1loqt21\" role=\"link\" href=\"/Cloudflare\" dir=\"ltr\">@Cloudflare</a> <br> Worker, with  <a style=\"color: rgb(29, 155, 240);\" class=\"css-1jxf684 r-bcqeeo r-1ttztb7 r-qvutc0 r-poiln3 r-1wvb978 r-1loqt21\" role=\"link\" href=\"/WorkOS\" dir=\"ltr\">@WorkOS</a> <br> 处理认证 and  <a style=\"color: rgb(29, 155, 240);\" class=\"css-1jxf684 r-bcqeeo r-1ttztb7 r-qvutc0 r-poiln3 r-1wvb978 r-1loqt21\" role=\"link\" href=\"/posthog\" dir=\"ltr\">@posthog</a> <br> 驱动分析  🌐 <br><br>后端运行在 <a style=\"color: rgb(29, 155, 240);\" class=\"css-1jxf684 r-bcqeeo r-1ttztb7 r-qvutc0 r-poiln3 r-1wvb978 r-1loqt21\" role=\"link\" href=\"/FastAPI\" dir=\"ltr\">@FastAPI 上，以 </a><a style=\"color: rgb(29, 155, 240);\" class=\"css-1jxf684 r-bcqeeo r-1ttztb7 r-qvutc0 r-poiln3 r-1wvb978 r-1loqt21\" role=\"link\" href=\"/Docker\" dir=\"ltr\">@Docker 镜像部署在 </a><a style=\"color: rgb(29, 155, 240);\" class=\"css-1jxf684 r-bcqeeo r-1ttztb7 r-qvutc0 r-poiln3 r-1wvb978 r-1loqt21\" role=\"link\" href=\"/Railway\" dir=\"ltr\">@Railway 上。它使用 </a><a style=\"color: rgb(29, 155, 240);\" class=\"css-1jxf684 r-bcqeeo r-1ttztb7 r-qvutc0 r-poiln3 r-1wvb978 r-1loqt21\" role=\"link\" href=\"/upstash\" dir=\"ltr\">@upstash Redis 进行限流，以及 </a><a style=\"color: rgb(29, 155, 240);\" class=\"css-1jxf684 r-bcqeeo r-1ttztb7 r-qvutc0 r-poiln3 r-1wvb978 r-1loqt21\" role=\"link\" href=\"/opentelemetry\" dir=\"ltr\">@opentelemetry + </a><a style=\"color: rgb(29, 155, 240);\" class=\"css-1jxf684 r-bcqeeo r-1ttztb7 r-qvutc0 r-poiln3 r-1wvb978 r-1loqt21\" role=\"link\" href=\"/AxiomFM\" dir=\"ltr\">@AxiomFM 实现可观测性，同时 </a><a style=\"color: rgb(29, 155, 240);\" class=\"css-1jxf684 r-bcqeeo r-1ttztb7 r-qvutc0 r-poiln3 r-1wvb978 r-1loqt21\" role=\"link\" href=\"/llama_index\" dir=\"ltr\">@llama_index LiteParse 处理 Markdown 转换步骤 🛠️ \n\n一如既往，它完全开源且可自托管：\n </a><a style=\"color: rgb(29, 155, 240);\" class=\"css-1jxf684 r-bcqeeo r-1ttztb7 r-qvutc0 r-poiln3 r-1wvb978 r-1loqt21\" role=\"link\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer nofollow\" href=\"http://github.com/AstraBert/pdfitdown-app\" dir=\"ltr\"><span class=\"css-1jxf684 r-bcqeeo r-1ttztb7 r-qvutc0 r-poiln3 r-qlhcfr r-19qo34d r-qvk6io r-orgf3d r-u8s1d\" aria-hidden=\"true\">http://</span>github.com/AstraBert/pdfi<span class=\"css-1jxf684 r-bcqeeo r-1ttztb7 r-qvutc0 r-poiln3 r-qlhcfr r-19qo34d r-qvk6io r-orgf3d r-u8s1d\" aria-hidden=\"true\">tdown-app</span><span class=\"css-1jxf684 r-bcqeeo r-1ttztb7 r-qvutc0 r-poiln3 r-lrvibr\" aria-hidden=\"true\">…</span></a>   😉 <br>留一点 ⭐  也留给 PdfItDown： <a style=\"color: rgb(29, 155, 240);\" class=\"css-1jxf684 r-bcqeeo r-1ttztb7 r-qvutc0 r-poiln3 r-1wvb978 r-1loqt21\" role=\"link\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer nofollow\" href=\"http://github.com/AstraBert/PdfItDown\" dir=\"ltr\"><span class=\"css-1jxf684 r-bcqeeo r-1ttztb7 r-qvutc0 r-poiln3 r-qlhcfr r-19qo34d r-qvk6io r-orgf3d r-u8s1d\" aria-hidden=\"true\">http://</span>github.com/AstraBert/PdfI<span class=\"css-1jxf684 r-bcqeeo r-1ttztb7 r-qvutc0 r-poiln3 r-qlhcfr r-19qo34d r-qvk6io r-orgf3d r-u8s1d\" aria-hidden=\"true\">tDown</span><span class=\"css-1jxf684 r-bcqeeo r-1ttztb7 r-qvutc0 r-poiln3 r-lrvibr\" aria-hidden=\"true\">…</span></a> </div><div class=\"tw-images\"><img src=\"https://pbs.twimg.com/amplify_video_thumb/2068755845920514048/img/VyGt4S-6nc3t6nWd?format=jpg&name=large\" alt=\"Embedded video\" /></div></article><hr/><h3>热门回复</h3><div class=\"tw-replies\"><div class=\"tw-reply\"><strong>@Clelia Bertelli (/acc)</strong> <span class=\"tw-eng\">♥ 8 · 💬 2</span><p>我决定在一个  @Cloudflare Worker  <br><br>如何？竟然如此容易：<br>• 启动一个  @qdrant_engine  集群并获取凭证<br>• 在边缘处理传入文件：用  @llama_index  LiteParse 并使用进行分块  @ChonkieAI ’s chunking library, both</p></div></div>",
    "pageContent": "Clelia Bertelli (/acc): 几乎可以将任何内容转换为 PDF 格式，使用 http://\npdfitdown.app ！ 我最近发布了 PdfItDown v3，这是我开发的一个用于将大多数文件格式转换为 PDF 的库。现在它还拥有一个全栈 Web 应用 :) The frontend is built with @tan_stack and deployed on a @Cloudflare Worker, with @WorkOS 处理认证 and @posthog 驱动分析 后端运行在 @FastAPI 上，以 @Docker 镜像部署在 @Railway 上。它使用 @upstash Redis 进行限流，以及 @opentelemetry + @AxiomFM 实现可观测性，同时 @llama_index LiteParse 处理 Markdown 转换步骤 一如既往，它完全开源且可自托管： http://\ngithub.com/AstraBert/pdfi\ntdown-app\n… 留一点 也留给 PdfItDown： http://\ngithub.com/AstraBert/PdfI\ntDown\n…\n![Embedded video](https://pbs.twimg.com/amplify_video_thumb/2068755845920514048/img/VyGt4S-6nc3t6nWd?format=jpg&name=large)\n\n链接:\n- http://pdfitdown.app\n- http://github.com/AstraBert/pdfitdown-app\n- http://github.com/AstraBert/PdfItDown\n---\n热门回复 (共 1 条):\n@Clelia Bertelli (/acc) (♥ 8 · 💬 2):\n我决定在一个  @Cloudflare Worker  \n\n如何？竟然如此容易：\n• 启动一个  @qdrant_engine  集群并获取凭证\n• 在边缘处理传入文件：用  @llama_index  LiteParse 并使用进行分块  @ChonkieAI ’s chunking library, both\n"
  },
